| Issuing authority | Ministry of Investment (وزارة الاستثمار, MISA); the "Competent Authority" for the excluded-activities list is the Standing Ministerial Committee for Examination of Foreign Investments (اللجنة الوزارية الدائمة لفحص الاستثمارات الأجنبية) constituted by Council of Ministers Resolution No. 83 of 30/1/1443H (Decree para. 3) |
